me><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Katz</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Steinitz</surname><given-names>RPDMYJLBCAaKL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title/><source>Cancer Incidence in Jewish Migrants to Israel, 1961&#x02013;1981</source><year>1989</year><volume>98</volume><publisher-name>Lyon: IARC Sci. Publ</publisher-name><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>311</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Incidence in Jewish Migrants to Israel, 1961&#x02013;1981||98|1||bib23|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>World Health Organization: International Classification of Diseases for Oncology, version</collab></person-group><article-title/><year>1979</year><publisher-name>Geneva: World Health Organization</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>